               TøS-SysInfo V1.0
          A SyS-Info door to DayDream


******************************************************************************

Well.... another useless door 4 DayDream

But this time in E ;) (NO MORE AREXX)

******************************************************************************

A Sys-info door that shows some shit like Free memory and Hd-space...... and
more... and more......

******************************************************************************

INSTALLATION


Write this into Daydream:display/iso/Welcome.gfx,txt

ÿDDayDream:TOS-Doors/tøs-sysinfo %N||
ÿN

Or this into DayDream.cfg

DOOR_COMMAND.. SYS
DOOR_TYPE..... 1
DOOR_SECURITY. 5
DOOR_EXECUTE.. DayDream:TOS-DOORS/TøS-SysInfo %N
DOOR_CONFS1... XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
DOOR_CONFS2... XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

And then copy ToS-Drawer into Daydream

